[{"title":"赠松窗","author":"陆文圭","text":"故交皆疏柳子厚，新贵不识王元之。\n袖中刺字已漫尽，一童犹负囊中诗。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6506,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"赠郑元明术士自言安晚之孙故诗及之","author":"陆文圭","text":"梁灏八十有二岁，自从天福逮雍熙。\n中更乾德五星聚，晚赐龙头拜玉墀。\n吾今之年灏相若，布衣落拓何能为。\n吟诗独与熊儿和，作赋那求狗监知。\n龙钟久纳少年侮，耿介尤为谄子嗤。\n吾闻长沙赵彦仁，豫知郑相秉化钧。\n从容杯酒托二子，端嘉之际俱名臣。\n是时宋德已衰谢，扶颠江左尚有人。\n安晚之孙今为庶，嗟我与子俱邅迍。\n不须谀我有许寿，且道何时脱子贫。\n清和四月天气新，共买一醉抛青春。\n穷通寿夭俱莫问，盖世英雄一窖尘，草间惟有石麒麟。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6507,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"赠星禽赵显微诗三绝 其三","author":"陆文圭","text":"奎宿如何号木狼，尾箕虎豹若为详。\n兽心人面凡皆是，瑞物如何无凤凰。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6508,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"赠柯山夏梅月","author":"陆文圭","text":"五星配五行，占法具春秋。\n参以四暗耀，不知始所由。\n经纬十二辰，一国系一州。\n三河即豫地，系宋复系周。\n晋自居太原，卫本都帝丘。\n借问益与并，古有二国不。\n三晋俱属冀，韩卫不见收。\n尝以扣日者，不语辄掉头。\n渠未通古今，敢问儒者流。\n气化互生尅，躔度有迟留。\n因之别贵贱，庶人与王侯。\n既云命在天，何以身不修。\n经籍古格言，较此殊不侔。\n殃庆有所积，祸福皆自求。\n理数各一家，二家果孰优。\n论数每多验，言理或不售。\n忠信人爵从，孟轲老于邹。\n仁者必有寿，牖下死伯牛。\n杀人取印绶，嬖主乘轩輶。\n将貂续狗尾，以冠加沐猴。\n市朝日汹汹，乾坤意悠悠。\n璇穹列高真，星月侍宸游。\n朝裾曳明霞，从佩鸣苍璆。\n居然视世浊，不肯分天忧。\n以此司罪福，反自招愆尤。\n我愿叫阊阖，再拜面凝旒。\n贪淫屏月孛，凶恶驱罗㬋。\n仁贤迭生旺，憸邪永休囚。\n帝阍不可扣，金锁闭玉楼。\n龙眠正齁睡，鸟语徒喧啾。\n路逢柯山翁，深碧明双眸。\n笑我地下臣，何豫天上谋。\n今夕有佳月，且共登罗浮。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6509,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"赠笔生杨日新","author":"陆文圭","text":"雪屋夜明寒，引纸一长吁。\n贫无食肉相，颇悔身业儒。\n晨出生谒入，被褐而长须。\n颖脱殊可喜，文翰定自娱。\n自言中山徒，常与陈玄俱。\n醉曾挥草圣，閒或写桃符。\n最爱王逸少，勉随刘寄奴。\n嗟生不自惜，貌泽神亦枯。\n世多宏肇辈，幸我非二苏。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6510,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"赠笔生林君实","author":"陆文圭","text":"我爱古人巧，创物掩前闻。\n遐哉苍颉氏，赖此蒙将军。\n将军绝地脉，乃解开人文。\n模写不得力，制作空云云。\n祇今千载下，艺圃专策勋。\n贬黜毛锥子，褒进中书君。\n工拙无定在，好恶有殊分。\n老我翻墨沈，落纸无烟云。\n有生来被褐，倩客试书裙。\n双金惭报赠，只字寄殷勤。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6511,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"赠曹德玉子达卿父子同赴锡山馆","author":"陆文圭","text":"故籯无黄金，子弟政欲佳。\n芬芳闻数里，譬若兰当阶。\n念昔登高门，始见玉在怀。\n顾余齿发尽，叹子头角乖。\n妙龄探学海，浩博无津涯。\n翁季遥相望，灯雪分一斋。\n翳翳山阳木，春风几时回。\n袅袅北堂萱，日暮意悠哉。\n游方非远道，心动数归来。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6512,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"赠道人周大方","author":"陆文圭","text":"道家者流双凤仙，迂访墙东老田叟。\n叟读儒书五十年，一事不成今白首。\n道人过门何所求，期将汗漫东北游。\n青蛇三尺风雷吼，玄鹤一声天地秋。\n吏商奔走日百里，区区嗜利与名耳。\n道眼视之海中沤，炎夏长途何必尔。\n吾师之师柱下史，紫气曾惊关尹喜。\n当时剩却五千言，焉用老人诗一纸。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6513,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"赠翟良甫洛人南游","author":"陆文圭","text":"温洛天地中，父老升平年。\n清游盘石坐，醒酒落花眠。\n胜地已陈迹，故事空遗编。\n铜驼泣秋雨，祸机始杜鹃。\n耆英日凋谢，嵩少无人烟。\n怀古笑我迂，慕学嗟子贤。\n购书或千金，卧榻馀一毡。\n低头肯揖吏，闭口不言钱。\n情已寄丘壑，足犹履山川。\n驾言远寻师，胡为近舍旃。\n煌煌邵程业，百世谁能传。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6514,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"赠潘道士祈雨","author":"陆文圭","text":"人天相距尺有咫，雷电六丁绕吾指。\n药师马上寄小瓢，夜半一滴洒千里。\n古湫源竭老蛟泣，新秧秀濯田畯喜。\n匣收宝剑捲阴符，师归宴坐茅峰里。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6515,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"露筋娘子庙","author":"陆文圭","text":"玉真仙子雪为肤，枉被群儿识塞酥。\n寂寞扶风三尺土，可怜香火至今无。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6516,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"题郑子实秋溪钓雨图","author":"陆文圭","text":"水墨淡淡，烟雨濛濛。\n溪抱前山，人倚孤篷。\n我怀季鹰，感慨秋风。\n身羁洛下，兴寄吴淞。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6517,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"题猿石手卷二首 其二","author":"陆文圭","text":"楚山无人，群戏树颠。\n或据大石，如君长然。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6518,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"题猿石手卷二首 其一","author":"陆文圭","text":"空山暮雨，枯木晓霜。\n此处闻声，若为断肠。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6519,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"王黄华山水小景二首 其二","author":"陆文圭","text":"此纸无脂粉气，之子有山水淫。\n当时以意摸写，今我以目登临。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6520,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"王黄华山水小景二首 其一","author":"陆文圭","text":"试问沧洲渔叟，长松山崦谁家。\n终日拿舟不语，江风吹老芦花。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6521,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"赤壁图二首 其二","author":"陆文圭","text":"乌台夜雨伤神，赤壁秋风岸巾。\n此老眼空四海，舟中二客何人。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6522,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"赤壁图二首 其一","author":"陆文圭","text":"公瑾子瞻二龙，文辞可敌武功。\n却怪紫烟烈焰，不如白月清风。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6523,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"题萧照山水","author":"陆文圭","text":"闭门十日风雨，神游湘浦峡川。\n树影分开草店，雁声吹落渔船。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6524,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"题戴嵩牛图","author":"陆文圭","text":"陇上躬耕力倦，归坐茅斋展卷。\n耳边如闻笛声，却看牧童不见。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6525,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"小桂二首 其二","author":"陈杰","text":"甲第人家万木犀，著忙曾看盛开时。\n日长小院差深静，时遣轻风破一枝。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6526,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"小桂二首 其一","author":"陈杰","text":"树小都来三尺长，撩人那得许生香。\n隔窗只道花如簇，才是梢头一粟黄。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6527,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"书生旧梦二解皆因榜过作 其二","author":"陈杰","text":"一著当机已百全，落枰忽误岂非天。\n空函堕甑都休惋，赤壁淮淝本偶然。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6528,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"六朝","author":"陈杰","text":"正朔奄奄一脉垂，不多文物迭兴衰。\n菰芦等是偏方士，尔尚生逢六季时。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6529,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"劝农同幕皆预即事四绝 其一","author":"陈杰","text":"铁骑雕戈夹道驰，元戎小队出郊时。\n白袍容与其间者，莫是参谋老拾遗。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6530,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"劝农同幕皆预即事四绝 其三","author":"陈杰","text":"风捲冈头似怒雷，晓来驱我上崔嵬。\n斗牛尽是登临处，到得清明却不来。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6531,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"劝农同幕皆预即事四绝 其二","author":"陈杰","text":"妥贴轻舆我自便，更施小帐暖如毡。\n前山一阵东风雨，马上诸郎陛楯然。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6532,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"劝农同幕皆预即事四绝 其四","author":"陈杰","text":"乌帽持觞鬓似银，近前不怕相公嗔。\n未知此日殷勤意，曾到深村作苦人。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6533,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"月窗相士","author":"陈杰","text":"明月谁令作鉴寒，纸窗何日透蝇钻。\n人间万事秋毫细，跳出须弥顶上看。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6534,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"见诸君感事之作","author":"陈杰","text":"鼎湖不挟宇宙去，骊墓曾包山海来。\n教儿倒诵阿房赋，一与张阳洗七哀。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6535,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"东湖晚步洪恩桥海棠洞三首 其三","author":"陈杰","text":"百花洲前万柳堤，一川红绿醉春时。\n楼台忽断见西爽，莺燕正深闻子规。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6536,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"东湖晚步洪恩桥海棠洞三首 其二","author":"陈杰","text":"雪前一枝玉出墙，独立小桥风信香。\n烂霞晴日炙蔫锦，十里软红人若狂。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6537,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"东湖晚步洪恩桥海棠洞三首 其一","author":"陈杰","text":"城里北风连夜号，平湖捲绿上枯壕。\n不知江水长多少，樯尾过城三丈高。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6538,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"古道","author":"陈杰","text":"杀鸡季伟蔬留客，列鼎孙弘外一肴。\n古道无存几夫子，今人何限不全交。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6539,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"龙湾野店同军校举杯","author":"陈杰","text":"饮边聊复得元子，坐上安非类蔡邕。\n袖取清谈铁如意，茫茫世事正蛇龙。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6540,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"灯夕解嘲和同官二首 其二","author":"陈杰","text":"同上南楼看月去，莫嫌官舍冷如僧。\n一株西北平安火，万里东南无尽灯。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6541,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"灯夕解嘲和同官二首 其一","author":"陈杰","text":"年光冉冉东流水，客恨匆匆旦过僧。\n门插一枝荆楚柳，梦回十里广陵灯。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6542,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"红梅","author":"陈杰","text":"千树江头雪作裳，一枝故欲犯时妆。\n分明瑩薄裁琼玉，不比胭脂抹海棠。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6543,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"老米暮景","author":"陈杰","text":"承平米家船，遗我独悽然。\n此岂有愁地，不能无暝天。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6544,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"至日拜赐","author":"陈杰","text":"千官万岁讲朝仪，黄伞高张簇仗齐。\n清晓山窗频扣首，虬须隆准伴宸奎。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6545,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"闭门","author":"陈杰","text":"闭门风雨九十日，生物趋新曾未休。\n适见桃枝暗明月，渐闻柳絮逐江流。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6546,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"伯文送海红柑及橄榄 其二","author":"陈杰","text":"微苦何妨著舌尖，就中永味已相兼。\n平生冰檗东坡老，直为群儿说蜜甜。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6547,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"伯文送海红柑及橄榄 其一","author":"陈杰","text":"外大如壶内不粗，闽山风物楚山无。\n后皇等是栽培力，消得千头与作奴。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6548,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"和友人生香四和","author":"陈杰","text":"水仙盆间瑞香盆，着一枝梅一干荪。\n个是山中生四和，麝沈枣甲更须论。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6549,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"和叶宋英三绝句 其三","author":"陈杰","text":"昌谷鲸蛇供诞幻，玉川騄駬玩虚空。\n独无桃实三千岁，更有鹏扶九万风。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6550,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"和叶宋英三绝句 其二","author":"陈杰","text":"大范寄诗题八十，龙韬照夜白虹寒。\n重纡剡雪归时棹，问讯磻璜约处滩。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6551,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"和叶宋英三绝句 其一","author":"陈杰","text":"千里论诗半语无，出门濠上子知鱼。\n寒潭潦尽水归壑，落日山明人荷锄。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6552,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"和州秋阳","author":"陈杰","text":"雨风睡过一年春，破闷无茶可策勋。\n失笑起来闻玉笛，懒晴吹涨满空云。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6553,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"和成修堂见寄吟稿韵二首 其二","author":"陈杰","text":"犹忆朝天晓漏迟，龙蛇暖日动旌旂。\n此生那复赓酬乐，风雪天涯各锻诗。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6554,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"和成修堂见寄吟稿韵二首 其一","author":"陈杰","text":"吟屋青山万垒间，割来风月少陵坛。\n可怜云树相望地，今作江东渭北看。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6555,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"和张纯父霜月三首 其三","author":"陈杰","text":"天公戏剧高寒上，岂识人间有凛秋。\n八万四千挥斧手，閒抛玉屑下琼楼。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6556,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"和张纯父霜月三首 其二","author":"陈杰","text":"茅店板桥天落趣，素娥青女洗长新。\n昔人已与不传死，千古谁怜老斲轮。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6557,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"和张纯父霜月三首 其一","author":"陈杰","text":"洞庭高秋乃无事，洞庭主人独多才。\n满天如水乌啼夜，写出寒蝉湿兔来。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6558,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"和徐子苍扬州梦梅","author":"陈杰","text":"林昏月落淮南夜，还忆江清水见沙。\n冰雪为魂玉在侧，了知不是梦梨花。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6559,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"和诸公琼花二首 其二","author":"陈杰","text":"淡日微云燕麦斜，江思笋蕨客思家。\n是非欲共东风语，一曲栏干眼自花。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6560,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"和诸公琼花二首 其一","author":"陈杰","text":"艳不山矾瘦不梅，全身夺得八仙胎。\n扬州怕有归来鹤，曾见无双槛里开。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6561,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"和落梅","author":"陈杰","text":"离离玉立已无多，颜色相于冷不阿。\n一种东风自根极，铜鞮最后谪仙歌。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6562,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"和雷侍郎省身湖上遇雪","author":"陈杰","text":"回舟望见雪来时，此兴山阴不与知。\n天上白衣殊变化，人间臭腐正神奇。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6563,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史","author":"陈杰","text":"蜀相犹雄懿已王，江东逮见魏先亡。\n山阳更在江东后，如此三分未用伤。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6564,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏归晚步","author":"陈杰","text":"风流顿尽万花浦，俛仰已陈双桂亭。\n黄鞠华差强人意，红拒霜犹有典刑。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6565,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏涂璋家屏风上题宣和壬寅季夏","author":"陈杰","text":"玉芝随手燕堂空，翠幰宸游黍满宫。\n一片宣和残岁月，百年田舍古屏风。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6566,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"试问","author":"陈杰","text":"试问屋藏书，何如斛贮珠。\n奄奄投阁老，凛凛坠楼姝。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6567,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"故人家","author":"陈杰","text":"蓬头历齿王霸子，葛帔练裙任昉儿。\n世绪何妨有凋落，若敖羊舌正堪悲。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6568,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"春事","author":"陈杰","text":"阳坡春事已全动，阴谷馀寒容未收。\n花雨一番成蝶梦，柳风十日看莺流。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6569,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"昭君","author":"陈杰","text":"千古和戎恨，冢青今尚闻。\n汉朝三尺草，埋没几昭君。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6570,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"笃志斋前新竹","author":"陈杰","text":"晕消旧习风前箨，怒长新功雨后竿。\n头角崭然真小友，雪霜岁晚更相观。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6571,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"贵要之客来","author":"陈杰","text":"幽居日对野人多，满耳桑麻不及他。\n惊怪朝来富新事，径容贵客偶相过。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6572,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"送林一甫试浙漕二首 其二","author":"陈杰","text":"偶题熟纸光浮桂，漫遣生绡色染蓝。\n入手功名如此耳，人间看北会成南。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":6573,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}}]